:answer/value "\\frac{44}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510695} :answer-field/id #uuid "6730e01e-de66-5eea-bfc8-6c0da58cc651" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510687}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "08e2c497-48ce-5260-bb75-340ad4b7ea14" :question/problem "Find the exact value of the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve $y=9x-2\\sqrt{x}$ at the point $(25,215).$\n\n$m=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "This time, we'll use $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ notation. First, we compute the derivative, which gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(9x-2\\sqrt{x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(9x-2{x}^{1/2}) \\\\  & =9-2\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}{x}^{-1/2} \\\\  & =9-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating at $x=25$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=25} & =9-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{25}} \\\\  & =9-\\frac{1}{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{44}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve at the point $(25,215)$ is\n\n$$\nm={\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=25}=\\frac{44}{5}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186510689 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d80b91f6-39ba-58a9-af71-6ae1f74b9224" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{18}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510694}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d80b91f6-39ba-58a9-af71-6ae1f74b9224" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{18}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510694} :answer-field/id #uuid "582b05a9-721f-55c9-8b5f-c6b352f58f5e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510686}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "7526651e-3bb1-5a8c-b6a7-9e835e617845" :question/problem "Find the exact value o